the socket received takes the datagram: [to itself]
-- Unix-domain sockets
received: 1 byte, UnixStream
the stream received reads what the other end wrote: [over a pair]
received: 1 byte, UnixListener
the listener received accepts: [accepted]
received: 1 byte, UnixDatagram
the datagram socket received receives: [to itself]
received: 1 byte, UnixDatagram
a datagram socket as a stream is InvalidInput: yes
